FSTA-Det

This repository contains an MMDetection-based implementation of frequency
enhancement and cross-window similarity aggregation for tiny object detection.

MMDetection
  Source: https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection
  Version: v2.23.0
  Copyright: OpenMMLab contributors
  License: Apache License 2.0, retained in LICENSE and source headers.
  Local extensions: FSTA feature modules and detector, VisDrone adapter,
  evaluator construction and empty-result handling, safe best-checkpoint
  replacement, single-GPU evaluation rescaling, and MMCV compatibility range.

CUST
  Source: https://github.com/jwgdmkj/CUST
  Reference commit: 037bfa9d912a44bfa4b3454276ce1db66150c7ac
  Copyright (c) 2024 Jeongsoo Kim
  License: MIT, retained in third_party/CUST_LICENSE.
  Adapted concepts: hierarchical scale residuals and representative-based
  token grouping, sorting, chunk attention and inverse-order restoration.

SET
  Source: https://github.com/HuixinSun/SET
  Reference commit: 9208fbc4cfe571be4c15dccad8db1665cfdcb9d6
  The FCOS experiment settings informed the initial training configurations.
  SET's HBS/API detector implementation is not distributed in this repository.
